[00:00.000] 作词 : Richard Anthony Hewson
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Richard Anthony Hewson
[00:50.705]I get messages from the stars
{"我收到来自星辰的讯息"}
[00:54.769]When you're making love to me
{"当你与我缠绵爱意"}
[00:59.790]I get messages from the stars
{"我收到来自星辰的讯息"}
[01:03.117]You must be from another galaxy
{"你定是来自另一星系"}
[01:11.147]When I'm out there all alone
{"当我独自漂泊在外"}
[01:15.664]And feeling far from home
{"感到远离家园的孤寂"}
[01:20.182]I'm fading into blue
{"我逐渐沉入忧郁"}
[01:24.700]And there's nothing I can do
{"却无能为力"}
[01:29.469]Then out on the sky like a flash
{"而后天际如电光闪现"}
[01:33.987]Sending me high, high, high
{"将我送往高远、高远、高远天际"}
[01:38.503]You rescue me
{"你拯救了我"}
[01:42.016]You saved me from a certain tragedy
{"你让我免于一场悲剧"}
